// claim: **Deep access / update — `>` navigates, and is the only form; `a[i][j]` is refused:**
m = [[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]]
n = 2
>> m[2>3] ¶           // → 6
>> m[-1>-1] ¶         // → 6
>> m[(n)>(n)] ¶       // → 5
>> (m[1>2]$~ 99) ¶    // → [[1, 99, 3], [4, 5, 6]]
>> m[[2>3]] ¶         // → [6]
>> m[1>1 ; 2>3] ¶     // → [1, 6]
>> m[[1>1] ; [2>3]] ¶ // → [[1], [6]]
>> m[[1>2..3]] ¶      // → [2, 3]
